DeepSeaFoam license scope

The original DeepSeaFoam application theme files under targets/ and generator
and supporting code under scripts/ are licensed under the MIT License in
licenses/MIT.txt. That license is also distributed with the application themes.

This grant does not relicense third-party material or product marks. Existing
upstream licenses and notices remain applicable. Solarized remains credited to
Ethan Schoonover; see https://ethanschoonover.com/solarized/.

No blanket license is granted for showcase artwork, photographs or third-party
icons. In particular, the supplied blobfish illustration has no established
redistribution license. See site/artwork-NOTICE.txt, site/icons/NOTICE.txt,
docs/showcase-artwork.json and docs/application-icons.json for provenance and
the applicable notices. Excluding artwork from this MIT grant is not a claim
that its existing rights have changed.
